    "text": "knimcountry.com\nwebsite\nHopkins\nFarm Broadcaster’s Humorous Reflections Now a Bestselling Book\n1 days ago\nTom Brand, a Hopkins native and farm broadcaster, has released “Welts on Your Butt a Calf Could Suck,” a book born from his “That Hopkins Kid” column in the Nodaway News Leader. The collection of humorous and heartfelt stories about rural Northwest Missouri life has resonated with readers, even reaching #1 on Amazon’s Rural Life…",
